{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33168","headline":"美刘太保 · 司马扎","name":"美刘太保","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常爱鲁仲连，退身得其趣。\n不知鸱夷子，更入五湖去。\n云霞恣摇曳，鸿鹄无低翥。\n万里天地空，清飙在平楚。\n藏名向宠节，辞疾去公务。\n夜尽醉弦歌，日高卧烟树。\n岂嗤生前乐，千载自垂裕。\n论道复论功，皆可黄金铸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马扎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}